    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$84.8\\text{ mm}$, equivalently $8.48\\text{ cm}$.\n\nConvert every measurement to millimetres before adding and dividing by $5$.",
      "worked": "Use millimetres: $8\\text{ cm}=80\\text{ mm}$, $12\\text{ cm}=120\\text{ mm}$ and $9.5\\text{ cm}=95\\text{ mm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{80+120+95+47+82}{5}\\text{ mm}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{424}{5}\\text{ mm}\\\\\\bar{x}&=84.8\\text{ mm}\\\\\\bar{x}&=8.48\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 38
